# longplay

English in code, docs, and prompts. Domain language: `docs/domain/ubiquitous-language.md`.

The agent loop is Strands, called from `apps/workout_album/runtime.py`. Catalog and session rules stay in `apps/workout_album/`. GitHub holds code; Ollama and keys stay local.

- Do not add LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, or LiteLLM.
- Swap models via env (`MODEL_*`, optional `FALLBACK_*`). Both are OpenAI-compatible `OpenAIModel`s. No `if provider ==`.
- Never commit `.env`, tokens, or model weights.
- Phone calls `POST /runs`, not Ollama/OpenRouter.
- Fit (album runtime vs session) beats listening taste.
- Phone / later ideas: `docs/product-later.md`. Do not implement activity trees or user listening history until asked.
